I keep handing over empty objects. This is systematic. My parameter values are coming through as empty objects. Let me try a totally different formatting approach. The XML syntax requires `<tag>value</tag>`. If I put JSON inside XML, sometimes the parser may try to interpret it differently.

Let me see if I should be using a different format entirely. Looking at the schema carefully again:

```
"parameters": {
  "properties": {
    "entity_ref": ...
    "content": ...
  }
}
```

With "additionalProperties": false.

For `entity_ref`, the schema accepts either object or string. So I could pass a string like "request:oauth-token" instead of an object! That might work better.
